@startuml Single Episode Task Workflow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title Single Episode Task Workflow\n(Traditional SABER Execution)

actor "Inspect AI\neval_async" as Eval
participant "saber_dataset()" as Dataset
participant "SingleEpisodeTaskHandler" as Handler
participant "Semaphore\n(max=8)" as Sem
participant "ClientSessionManager" as Session
participant "SABER Server" as Server
participant "Episode Container" as Container

== Task Creation ==
Eval -> Dataset: Load tasks
Dataset -> Dataset: Create SingleEpisodeTask\n(task_id="cybench_001")
note right
  **SingleEpisodeTask:**
  - task_id: "cybench_001"
  - domain: "cybersecurity"
  - max_steps: 50
  - prompts: instruction, assistant, submit
end note

== Episode Initialization ==
Eval -> Handler: initialize(task, session_id, semaphore)
activate Handler

Handler -> Sem: acquire() [async]
note right: Block if 8 episodes running
Sem --> Handler: ✓ Acquired (7/8 slots free)
Handler -> Handler: _semaphore_acquired = True

Handler -> Session: create_episode(session_id, "cybench_001")
Session -> Server: POST /episodes/create
Server -> Container: docker run --name cybench_001
Container --> Server: Container ID
Server --> Session: EpisodeCreateResponse\n(episode_id="ep_123")
Session --> Handler: episode_id="ep_123"

Handler -> Session: wait_for_episode_ready(session_id, "ep_123")
Session -> Server: GET /episodes/ep_123/status [poll]
Server --> Session: state="ready"
Session --> Handler: ✓ Ready

Handler --> Eval: state = {\n  episode_ids: ["ep_123"],\n  primary_episode_id: "ep_123",\n  semaphore_acquired: True\n}
deactivate Handler

== Agent Execution (External) ==
note over Eval, Container
  Agent runs autonomously using episode_id="ep_123"
  - Executes commands via MCP tools
  - Records steps (step 1, 2, 3, ...)
  - Submits final answer
end note

== Episode Cleanup ==
Eval -> Handler: cleanup(state, session_id, semaphore)
activate Handler

Handler -> Session: end_episode(session_id, "ep_123")
Session -> Server: POST /episodes/ep_123/end
Server -> Container: docker stop cybench_001
Container --> Server: Stopped
Server --> Session: ✓ Ended
Session --> Handler: ✓ Success

Handler -> Sem: release()
note right: Free semaphore slot
Sem --> Handler: ✓ Released (8/8 slots free)
Handler -> Handler: _semaphore_acquired = False

Handler --> Eval: CleanupResult(\n  success=True,\n  semaphore_released=True\n)
deactivate Handler

@enduml
